# CLAUDE.md

This file provides guidance to Claude Code (claude.ai/code) when working with code in this repository.

## About This Project

`pyintelliclima` is a Python library for communicating with IntelliClima ECOCOMFORT 2.0 and
ECOCOMFORT 3 ventilation devices via their proprietary cloud API. The API was reverse-engineered
from the IntelliClima+ Android app — there is no public API, so the library may break if
IntelliClima changes their server.

The primary intended use is as a dependency for a Home Assistant integration.

